          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP284 Leavitt &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Touring some of the back roads in southern Alberta and picking up a few caps. This one took a while to find as there was no marker post nearby. Thanks for the cap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
