          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP284 – Leavitt

N 49° 11.753 W 113° 20.528&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was interesting to see 4 or 5 bear traps being stored in the maintenance yard on our way to this cap.  We weren’t having any luck finding it in all the vegetation so I pulled out my compass and was thrilled to see the deflection that showed us exactly where the cap was hiding.  Thank you for the brass cap; the information and picture have been e-mailed.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
